<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;"><div class="wrap narrow prose">
  <p>This is a static website. It has no accounts, no advertising and no analytics or tracking cookies.</p>
  <h2>What is stored</h2>
  <p>Your colour theme choice (light or dark) is saved in your own browser so the site remembers it. Nothing else is stored.</p>
  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>The contact form does not send anything to this website. It prepares an email in your own email application, and you choose whether to send it. If you email me, I use your message only to reply to you.</p>
  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages and loads fonts from Google Fonts; both may log your IP address as part of delivering the page. Video thumbnails are loaded from YouTube, and a YouTube player is loaded only when you press play on a video.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
</div></section>
